## Fairness (F1 to F3, information beside the difficulty change)

The lines are in scripts/challenge/fairness.json. F1 telegraph share: hull lost to a hit whose own source had a telegraph over the ball for at least 0.6 s, over that plus hull from sources that publish telegraphs and had none in time; pass >= 95% and every killing hit shown. Contact hull (body contact and ram, no telegraph by design) is printed beside it and is outside the share; unknown is hull whose source has no telegraph owner to match, and F1 carries no mark while unknown is over 5% of hull. F2 stop tax: hull per second below cruise speed over hull per second at or above it; pass >= 2.0; the share of time at cruise is printed beside it. F3 first hit: median seconds from first contact with a pack to the first hit, one reading per stage and per boss fight; pass >= 3 s; a stage with no hit reads as later than any, and a hit that itself opened contact is counted apart. One line per cell and arm, with the runs behind it; runs graded error or unresumed are left out. "not measured" means no run carried the number; it is never read as zero.

- w1clear novice (24 of 24 runs measured): F1 100% of 3956.3 hull shown ✓, killing hits shown 8 of 8 ✓; contact 0.0 hull, unknown 0.0 hull (0% of hull); F2 stop tax 4.72 ✓, 25% of time at cruise; F3 first hit 68.6 s median over 33 stage readings ✓, 0 of 33 took no hit.
- w1clear learner1 (24 of 24 runs measured): F1 100% of 1004.3 hull shown ✓, killing hits shown none counted; contact 0.0 hull, unknown 0.0 hull (0% of hull); F2 stop tax 3.40 ✓, 34% of time at cruise; F3 first hit 68.8 s median over 56 stage readings ✓, 6 of 56 took no hit.
- w1clear learner5 (24 of 24 runs measured): F1 100% of 826.6 hull shown ✓, killing hits shown none counted; contact 0.0 hull, unknown 0.0 hull (0% of hull); F2 stop tax 4.63 ✓, 36% of time at cruise; F3 first hit 68.8 s median over 56 stage readings ✓, 6 of 56 took no hit.
- w1clear expert (24 of 24 runs measured): F1 100% of 558.4 hull shown ✓, killing hits shown none counted; contact 0.0 hull, unknown 0.0 hull (0% of hull); F2 stop tax 3.05 ✓, 40% of time at cruise; F3 first hit 65.6 s median over 72 stage readings ✓, 12 of 72 took no hit.

No cell has a ✗ against a win-rate target.

